(C14: as phi_flow1 with nu = 0.25 [M/G = 3]. GNU rule k = [M/G] tan[psi]
[consistent elastic return]; the Professional uses k = 2 tan[psi] and gives
sxy 6.92049e-4, syy -1.26679e-3 [documented divergence, BACKLOG].)
